{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_94_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_94","textTraditional":"一、三十有一年，春，取濟西田。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_94_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_94","textTraditional":"二、公子遂如晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_94_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_94","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月，四卜郊，不從，乃免牲，猶三望。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_94_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_94","textTraditional":"夏四月，不時也。四卜，非禮也。免牲者，為之緇衣熏裳，有司玄端奉送，至於南郊。免牛亦然。乃者，亡乎人之辭也。猶者，可以已之辭也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_94_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_94","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_94_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_94","textTraditional":"五、冬，杞伯姬來求婦。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_94_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_94","textTraditional":"婦人既嫁不踰竟，杞伯姬來求婦，非正也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_94_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_94","textTraditional":"六、狄圍衞。十有二月，衞遷於帝丘。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}